<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8900016a2362> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla car was on Autopilot when it hit a Culver City firetruck, NTSB finds" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1793" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/bc73b13be694> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1793] The National Transportation Safety Board said Tuesday that the driver never saw the parked firetruck and didn’t brake." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1793" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c0aaa9ec3482> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla Police Blotter News - Tesla Driver Hits Parked Firetruck - Blames Autopilot" ;
