<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/db964241aefc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "This accident sounds eerily similar to a deadly crash in which a Tesla on Autopilot struck a huge white semi-trailer in its path. In that crash, the NTSB pinned some of the blame on the Tesla Autopilot system." ;
