<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/20c0b7dd141f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Simulations done by Cognata of this crash suggest that it is possible the camera was set to too bright an exposure, and the bright white truck was just an overexposed blob." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1537" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/462891a95b42> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A Tesla driving on autopilot on National Highway 1 barely missed a pedestrian and collided into an overturned truck on Monday (June 1)." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1538" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4714474b97ff> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1793] A government report says the driver of a Tesla sedan that slammed into a Culver City firetruck on the 405 Freeway last year was using the car’s Autopilot system" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1793" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4a1c48ea6a69> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1538] The driver of the Tesla was a 53-year-old man surnamed Huang (黃), who claimed that he had set the car to run on autopilot at a speed of 110 kilometers per hour prior to the accident." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1538" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/523f9908e9c5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A government report says the driver of a Tesla sedan that slammed into a Culver City firetruck on the 405 Freeway last year was using the car’s Autopilot system when a vehicle in front of him suddenly changed lanes and he didn’t have time to react." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1793" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5c48f0b44d0e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A driver's inattention, overreliance on his car's advanced driver assistance system, and use of the system inconsistent with manufacturer guidance, coupled with the system permitting driver disengagement from the driving task, led to the Jan. 22, 2018, crash in Culver City, California, according to a National Transportation Safety Board brief issued Wednesday." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1794" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5efcd832759b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The driver reported the Tesla S was on autopilot and he was not paying attention." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1794" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6694607d06fd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla car was on Autopilot when it hit a Culver City firetruck, NTSB finds" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1793" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6aaf1c3409c8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Apparently the man’s 2014 Tesla Model S didn’t brake either." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1793" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6d62c25700dc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1792] In that crash, the NTSB pinned some of the blame on the Tesla Autopilot system." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1792" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/913374b3d63d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Video shows Tesla on autopilot slam into truck on Taiwan highway" ;
