<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d4a38e85d286> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The results of the NTSB's investigation of the crash involved a Tesla Model S P85 and a Culver City Fire Department Culver City Engine 42 in the high-occupancy vehicle lane of southbound Interstate 405." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1794" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e46cba4f5ce2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In addition, Tesla’s “Automatic Emergency Braking” is generally never off unless manually disabled, as are the collision warning systems." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1537" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e78932e575e4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "NTSB Issues Report on Tesla Crash with Culver City Fire Engine" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1794" .

